          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-19768 obdclass: add table-driven netlink framework",
        "message": "LU-19768 obdclass: add table-driven netlink framework\n\nIntroduce a reusable table-driven netlink handler framework\n(lustre_nl_ctx) that factors out the common start/dump/done\npattern shared by commands that iterate OBD devices.\n\nEach command supplies a descriptor with collect, pack_msg, and\nsetup / release callbacks.\n\nAlso fix several bugs in the existing stats dump path:\n- Add missing nla_put return-value checks\n- Fix an off-by-one in key-list sizing\n- Fix a typo (\"togther\" -> \"together\").\n\nTLC-bug-id: TLU-56\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nSigned-off-by: Minh Diep <mdiep@thelustrecollective.com>\nSigned-off-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nChange-Id: Ic3267111785fe79761f0673477149f7fca470a34\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
